      "value": "<h2>Lucid Footing</h2><p><em>In the Lane, the dream cushions your mistakes.</em></p><hr /><h3>Rules</h3><p>While you walk the <strong>Lane</strong>, misfires land <strong>two bands safer</strong> and the <strong>Blood-Debt</strong> cost of reaching is reduced by <strong>1</strong>.</p><p style=\"font-size:0.8rem;opacity:0.85;margin:0.5rem 0 0\"><strong>Requires:</strong> Dreamwalker</p><p style=\"font-size:0.74rem;opacity:0.7;margin:0.5rem 0 0\">⚙ Applies automatically while the Walking-Lane stance is active: misfire band −2, reach Blood-Debt −1.</p>",
